# After the Aurora Trial

## Get a renewed token / commercial licence

Email [sales@zyvor.dev](mailto:sales@zyvor.dev) with your company name and preferred term.
You will receive a new signed **`trial.token`** (Ed25519 JWT) — not an HMAC string.

## Apply your token

### Docker / Podman

```bash
# Option A — file (recommended): replace the shipped token
cp /path/from/sales/trial.token ./trial.token

# Option B — env
# in .env:
AURORA_TRIAL_TOKEN=<jwt from sales>
# or legacy alias:
# AURORA_LICENSE_KEY=<jwt from sales>

docker compose -f docker-compose.trial.yml --env-file .env up -d
# or: podman compose ...
```

Compose mounts `./trial.token` into the API/workers at `/app/trial.token`.

### Helm

```bash
kubectl create secret generic aurora-license \
  --from-literal=license.key="<jwt from sales>" \
  -n aurora

helm upgrade aurora ./charts/aurora-*.tgz \
  --namespace aurora \
  --reuse-values \
  --set license.existingSecret=aurora-license

kubectl -n aurora rollout restart deploy
```

### Verify

```bash
curl -s https://<your-host>/api/v1/license/status
# {"licensed": true, "trial_expired": false, "design": "signed-trial-token", ...}
```

